            <div xml:id="m-66d94f23-b579-4909-8e29-be6c5769e8fb">
              <lg xml:id="m-830e0534-b427-4d6d-bb23-453c27a38dc9">
                <l xml:id="m-86eb887b-7459-4e14-bc13-b3aa78cd284d" facs="#m-443dbaaf-069d-4833-a69e-ff193010fd3a" label="text-like">Saturday at Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-07a7245a-b0cf-4e0b-a4c1-31f8b289dc17" facs="#m-7de7470e-da6d-4d88-a532-2dffe622a09a" label="ambiguous">307</l><l xml:id="m-0738af6d-93b8-4a55-a59c-f1afb422b63e" facs="#m-34a3eef1-2624-477e-863a-add12edcb8a1" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-03bffd45-8494-425f-9503-26cc5782fb69" facs="#m-13d6aef5-2670-4fd2-b8b4-c6196f60897b" label="lyrics-like">Voce mé¬ a ad Dóminum clamávi,</l><l xml:id="m-ef4c03ef-8d68-4e37-bce4-547204b87f1f" facs="#m-2e779e81-c257-47c0-8725-1522ef91a6de" label="ambiguous">neque obli¬</l><l xml:id="m-2aa86d81-3745-4f01-84ed-1fde194af764" facs="#m-da0b0625-4d4a-4230-82c3-b7099fa5d9a4" label="lyrics-like">viscé-tur mi-seré-ri Dé-us.</l><l xml:id="m-3ce1f071-d422-4064-a9eb-9dd8383c5085" facs="#m-324706f8-3c63-4e93-88f5-a6fbeaea7228" label="ambiguous">P. T.</l><l xml:id="m-1f215c56-c1d9-42e7-a39f-3c367acbe897" facs="#m-45d47230-9827-4c4c-97bf-ea28b539d06d" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-c96f7810-e82d-46e2-ba4f-83bd6d500466" facs="#m-db62956b-4d02-470a-976e-044ace771334" label="lyrics-like">Alle-lú-ia, alle-lú-ia, alle-lú¬ia</l><l xml:id="m-49bf8e4b-d506-498d-98ca-aefc4aa5a79c" facs="#m-00c1943a-bbf5-4d99-ad58-720b2096b3f5" label="text-like">SATURDAY AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-1afd985a-c55a-4c14-881b-d007fe2c25e2" facs="#m-5ea6eb6e-ddab-4ce6-bdf4-949832161ffe" label="text-like">The following Antiphons and Psalms are always said on Saturday during</l><l xml:id="m-15e1354f-ed78-4481-970c-b14c392010bc" facs="#m-a00d40a7-d5d9-48f6-ae1d-fd1eac5341bf" label="lyrics-like">the rear for the ist Vespers of the Sunday, whenever the Office of thẽ Sundar</l><l xml:id="m-8ff3ecdf-8d5e-433a-a8a5-31d6081814a3" facs="#m-6380c429-1b20-4108-87c6-2fc8dd6544cf" label="text-like">is to be said as in the Psalter. In Paschal Time, these Psalms arc said</l><l xml:id="m-6941aa8b-c86f-4d86-acc7-4988128d9627" facs="#m-06ee508d-ec66-4125-80ad-ff0ca2ff1397" label="text-like">under one Antiphon. Alleluia.</l><l xml:id="m-e3e71002-ad30-45d1-84f1-a01a98787153" facs="#m-971a19a3-9170-4097-ab9b-0ee35e05b80f" label="text-like">In Advent, for ist Vespers of the Sunday, the Antiphons of and Vespers</l><l xml:id="m-c6ca182a-61fe-430b-8c66-407c22980833" facs="#m-41c4a2a1-be73-44bb-b285-25d0bf44cead" label="text-like">of that Sunday are said with the Psalms of Saturday.</l><l xml:id="m-1a363425-4802-48f3-971e-bfe8f90f5a18" facs="#m-56b6deba-f9d8-4f7d-8956-4368e8d0c038" label="ambiguous">Tae Officiant.</l><l xml:id="m-2da5f3ad-32da-4442-a22d-b3ad792bacfa" facs="#m-831e3df2-d31d-4ec4-ab48-828f94c79389" label="text-like">The Cantor.</l><l xml:id="m-af894019-dc9f-45c2-a81e-40d99944032c" facs="#m-ea7f531a-1fea-4246-a64f-ae3c381d05d6" label="ambiguous">Tae Officiant.</l><l xml:id="m-e9c0f65f-3054-4976-a0ee-39581205d7b7" facs="#m-18dab006-b8e2-419b-b01a-fc4f92f717ea" label="ambiguous">T</l><l xml:id="m-6a39791b-c949-4fa2-a8b1-85095e013332" facs="#m-a070d4a8-d792-4582-a993-92431e07e979" label="ambiguous">1. Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-a7c84b3d-be6a-40dc-9654-e2b6095c0319" facs="#m-0820f1fb-1baa-46ab-8890-a551f2363d14" label="ambiguous">Ant. G.1</l><l xml:id="m-391739e2-c0db-453b-8dda-0194ee514c10" facs="#m-a2f57e14-57b4-4b7a-b6cf-a768f947e383" label="ambiguous">6.f</l><l xml:id="m-155f5b75-4adf-4e6c-92f7-5f0dc8b6c4a6" facs="#m-4e462995-6efe-4f2a-bbf2-df349f4190fc" label="ambiguous">B</l><l xml:id="m-690e6250-4a28-48ce-9ac0-4cfa1150df8f" facs="#m-c1af9d0a-b97f-4eaf-be77-b21b62042eae" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-7c2c0139-09f5-4828-a0fd-0a6a5aace84e" facs="#m-838ed5c4-2548-46a7-93e3-40492999962b" label="lyrics-like">Lle lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-24811202-495a-487a-a4a3-3f5f68575b2d" facs="#m-1f148492-ece9-405b-9115-f4c5a157cfe5" label="lyrics-like">Enedíctus. Dóminus Dé-us, etc.</l><l xml:id="m-74a54ee9-20fa-4dff-b683-2b2e93e9fdd1" facs="#m-aa852685-d59f-4974-a804-4066d4186c7f" label="ambiguous">Psalm 143. I.</l><l xml:id="m-fca6d737-2ca1-4809-8a9c-f038a7fb7194" facs="#m-2c328425-9962-4522-8213-3ba4c3f1033c" label="text-like">The Cantor.</l><l xml:id="m-c221a732-069c-4fd2-9781-4ca600bdb58d" facs="#m-c4cc977d-6c33-4ab0-8428-0a908ce98009" label="lyrics-like">1. Benedictus Dóminus Dé-us mé-us, qui dócet mánus mé-as</l><l xml:id="m-84a7b5bd-d920-454c-bf62-088ac568f0e1" facs="#m-53db3a7a-f81e-4ff8-836e-65654c6a2487" label="text-like">The Choir.</l><l xml:id="m-9fe69739-c0f7-4d27-95ef-13aab0c62bb6" facs="#m-d89bdb1f-826a-4c96-94ae-3da99a784f33" label="lyrics-like">ad praéli-um,</l><l xml:id="m-9c784b50-0b61-49b9-9f70-26c6f128b163" facs="#m-a18eaf61-4448-44bf-8ae2-0d348d24cade" label="lyrics-like">et dí-gi-tos mé-os ad bél- lum.</l><l xml:id="m-a3c3e54b-b20c-40d2-ac5a-afa774d0e9d3" facs="#m-e83a64c8-369f-4e32-8b1e-3cc08afc9c54" label="ambiguous">Flez : alto,</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>